OL,3,AJury in Tupac Shakur trial finds Duane
OL,4,A'Keffe D' Davis guilty of murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuane "Keffe D" Davis, a 63-year-old
OL,7,Fformer gang boss, has been found guilty
OL,8,Fof murdering rapper Tupac Shakur
OL,10,FThe famous rapper was shot multiple
OL,11,Ftimes on 7 September 1996 in a drive-by
OL,12,Fshooting in Las Vegas and died several
OL,13,Fdays later
OL,15,FDavis was unexpectedly charged with
OL,16,Fmurder in 2023 and has been standing
OL,17,Ftrial in Las Vegas
OL,19,FDavis was charged with murder with a
OL,20,Fdeadly weapon. He faces potentially
OL,21,Flife in prison without parole
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
